  "_doc": "A salamander that hunts the tubes at a run. P1 \"The Run\": she charges the length of the gallery and leaves a burning trail where she ran (pools), bites, and spits a glob that splashes. Three glass knobs stand in the room (pillars): her Sunflash glare is blocked by them. P2 at 45% \"Hot Tail\": she calls the crawlers out of the cracks and her tail lash sweeps a wide arc behind and in front.",
